I'd go for the McCoy's salt and vinegar, because they're my usual and I'm not having a photo of a tumour put me off a bag of crisps, though I'd probably roll my eyes at the label since it's the kind of preachy thing that never looks at a receipt. Also, with my sugar creeping up, I'm steering clear of the chocolate anyway.

Actually, hang on, if the graphic labels are only on the high-calorie stuff, the crisps will have one too, and I'd still take them and just not look at the front.

